Package: patccatClaims
Title: Product vs Process U.S. Patent Claim Classifier
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bernhard", "Ganglmair", email = "b.ganglmair@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3821-2813")),
    person("W. Keith", "Robinson", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2522-6167")))
Description: Rule-based classifier that labels U.S. patent claims as product or
    process and extracts claim-structure flags (means-plus-function, Jepson,
    Beauregard, single-line, and others), operating over udpipe part-of-speech
    tags. This is the core classifier of the patccat pipeline, packaged for
    standalone use.
